{"id":"n65049-3-6","stage":1,"title":"싸다 · 装","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65049-3-6-1","ko":"아직 이삿짐도 안 쌌는데 큰일이다.","zh":"还没开始收拾搬家物品，可麻烦了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이삿짐도","meaning":"搬家的东西","explanation":"이삿짐：搬家的东西；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71996","senseId":"1","lemma":"이삿짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌌는데","meaning":"装，打包","explanation":"싸다：装，打包；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65049","senseId":"3","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰일이다.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"2ad758f1225008c2","term":"이삿짐","zh":"搬家的东西","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3","entryId":"71996","definition":"搬家时搬运的行李。","pronunciation":["이사찜","이삳찜"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"装，打包","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"65049","definition":"为了将某个东西运往别处而用箱子、绳子或布等包起来。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]}],"audio":"/audio/4de48ec8c5ec3adcccb3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65049-3-6-2","ko":"너 내일이 이사라고 하지 않았어?","zh":"你不是说明天要搬家吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일이","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이사라고","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf38351cd3a3ad83dad4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65049","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.6455,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还没开始收拾搬家物品，可麻烦了。","你不是说明天要搬家吗？","智秀的男朋友又换人了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还没开始收拾搬家物品，可麻烦了。","你不是说明天要搬家吗？","智秀的男朋友又换人了。"],"answer":1}]}
